Cell["\<\
Returns {H, V, W}. V[[a]] is the first momentum derivative and W[[a,b]] is \
the second momentum derivative.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->986150729,ExpressionUUID->"c09c330c-205c-3846-88db-5982ea4596fa"],

Cell["\<\
No factors of hbar are inserted. The Hessian contribution from displacement r \
is -r[[a]] r[[b]] Exp[-I r.k] h.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1748208266,ExpressionUUID->"a0f8ea51-cc41-3d4a-ac8c-82f444c45ee9"],

Cell["\<\
Requires numeric vector keys and SparseArray values, with onsite first and \
one representative per reverse-hopping pair.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->194679149,ExpressionUUID->"cd552c48-29af-964c-862f-88661b4559cd"]
}, Closed]],

